v 3
d 'SUSO': module providing a Stata client for the Survey Solutions REST API
d
d suso is a Stata interface to the World Bank Survey Solutions REST API and
d includes paradata timing, behaviour flags, historical removal review,
d hierarchy-aware final-data enablement adjudication, and a tabbed QC suite.
d Build: 2026-08-13-RUNKEYMISSFIX (v1.7.12; Java backend 1.7.11-AUDITFIX).
d
d Requires: Stata 14.2 or newer and Java 11 or newer.
d Distribution-Date: 20260813
d Author: Attique Ur Rehman, The World Bank
d Support: email attique@worldbank.org
d
f suso.ado
f suso.sthlp
f suso.jar
